, and Kurdish.\n\n Prayer & Worship\n• Accurate prayer times based on your location, with multiple calculation methods\n• A real-time Qibla compass to find the direction of the Kaaba anywhere\n• Morning & evening adhkar to open and close your day with remembrance\n• A digital tasbih (dhikr counter) to keep your dhikr close\n\n Reminders in Your Own Voice\n• Prayer-time notifications so you never miss a salah\n• Daily spoken reminders — hear an uplifting message at the time you choose\n• Gentle nudges to build and keep your good habits\n\n Learn & Grow\n• Structured courses on Salah, Qur'an reading, seerah, productivity, and more\n• Inspiring podcasts to listen to on the go\n• A daily quote to reflect on, save, and revisit\n\n Reflect\n• A private journal for your thoughts, du'as, and gratitude\n• Bookmark the quotes, episodes, and lessons that move you\n• Track your prayers, habits, and progress over time\n\nBuilt for You\n• Fully available in English, العربية, and کوردی\n• A clean, distraction-free design made to bring you closer to your faith\n• Your data is yours — manage or permanently delete your account anytime\n\nLesan Sidq means \"a tongue of truth.\" Our mission is simple: to give young Muslims a trusted companion for a life of faith, learning, and sincerity.\n\nDownload Lesan Sidq and start your journey today.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "36749312", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 0}]}